#compdef cdreplay

# Replay the compdef calls deferred while compinit was not yet loaded
# (zinit turbo mode).
#
# zshrs builtin. builtin_cdreplay (src/extensions/ext_builtins.rs) looks
# for a `-q` word anywhere in its argv and ignores everything else.
# Bundled into ~/.zshrs/functions by build.rs.

_arguments '-q[do not report the number of replayed compdef calls]'
